Rollback Integration

Integrate the Snapshots feature directly with the existing Rollback process.

When a user selects Rollback, they should be able to:

View all available snapshots for the selected asset.
Select the specific snapshot to restore.
Preview the snapshot details before restoring.
Confirm the rollback operation.
