Verify the asset after restoration.
Automatic Rollback

If a migration fails during validation, compatibility testing, or health checks, QGuard Helix should automatically:

Detect the failure.
Notify the administrator.
Restore the asset using the latest valid pre-migration snapshot (if automatic rollback is enabled).
Log the rollback event.
Preserve all audit evidence.
